# Bus Ticket Booking Portal

A web-based bus ticket booking application built as a lab final project. The platform allows users to browse routes, enter passenger details, and complete a ticket booking workflow through a simple and user-friendly interface.

## Live Demo

Try the project here:

[Live Demo](PASTE_YOUR_LINK_HERE)

---

## Features

- Route and bus selection
- Passenger information handling
- Multi-step booking workflow
- Booking confirmation process
- Clean and intuitive interface

---

## Project Overview

This project was built to explore web application workflows and practical problem-solving through a real-world booking system.

The focus was on:
- Designing a smooth booking experience
- Organising booking and passenger information
- Building a structured user flow
- Improving UI clarity and usability

---

## Tech Stack

- Web-based frontend
- Interactive UI workflows
- Backend/data handling concepts
- Built using Emergent

